# REVIEW-M1 F10: the root .gitignore's private-data patterns are root-anchored
# (docs/conventions/data-handling.md's `local`/`private` classes), so anything
# under this tree's own data/tests/fixtures directories was committable
# despite the root patterns' intent. Anchored here too, not only at the root.
data/private/
tests/fixtures/private/
tests/fixtures/local/**
